  "description": {
    "en": "Babolat AddiXion+ is a reinforced multifilament designed to combine comfort, durability and power. Compared with the previous AddiXion, it offers up to 25% longer durability while maintaining the soft feel and elasticity expected from a multifilament. Slightly firmer than Babolat Xcel, it delivers more direct response and dynamic power, making it an excellent choice for club players who frequently break traditional multifilament strings.",
    "zh": "Babolat AddiXion+ 是一款强化型多芯球线，兼顾舒适、耐久与力量输出。相比上一代 AddiXion，其耐久性提升最高可达 25%，同时依然保持多芯线优秀的舒适性和弹性。它比 Xcel 略硬、反馈更直接、力量更充足，非常适合经常打断普通多芯线、但又不希望改用聚酯线的俱乐部球员。"
  },

